Package: firmware-piano
Version: 0.1.0
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: liisoya <liisoya@users.noreply.github.com>
Conflicts: linux-firmware
Replaces: linux-firmware
Provides: linux-firmware
Description: Xiaomi Pad 8 Pro (piano) device firmware
 ath12k WiFi (PEACH hw2.0), adsp/cdsp MPDs, novatek touch firmware,
 qca bluetooth and other device firmware for piano mainline Linux.
 The binary payloads are fetched at build time from
 blu-sharky/piano-firmware (this package ships the skeleton only);
 firmware blobs are (c) Qualcomm/Xiaomi and friends, for use on the
 owner's own device.
